{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Memory Showdown</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Memory meets mayhem! Classic card matching turns into a tactical showdown!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Memory Showdown</i> is a unique card battle game that combines the nostalgic gameplay of concentration (a.k.a. memory match) with intense turn-based combat.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd25 Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Match number cards to deal damage to your opponent\u2019s HP!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The higher the number, the stronger the hit \u2014 test both your memory and your strategy!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flip a hidden item card and gain powerful advantages mid-battle!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use healing, traps, buffs, and more to turn the tide in your favor!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfae Easy to learn, hard to master:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take turns flipping cards \u2014 it\u2019s that simple!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be the first to bring your opponent\u2019s HP to zero and claim victory!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s not just about memory \u2014 use items, strategy, and mind games to dominate the showdown!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3794570?t=1756776449","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3794570?t=1756776449","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794570/ac39f4ba94c858f91876a0e8bbf12f04acc6ae26/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756776449","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794570/ac39f4ba94c858f91876a0e8bbf12f04acc6ae26/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756776449","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Memory Showdown</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Memory meets mayhem! Classic card matching turns into a tactical showdown!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Memory Showdown</i> is a unique card battle game that combines the nostalgic gameplay of concentration (a.k.a. memory match) with intense turn-based combat.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd25 Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Match number cards to deal damage to your opponent\u2019s HP!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The higher the number, the stronger the hit \u2014 test both your memory and your strategy!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flip a hidden item card and gain powerful advantages mid-battle!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use healing, traps, buffs, and more to turn the tide in your favor!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfae Easy to learn, hard to master:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take turns flipping cards \u2014 it\u2019s that simple!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be the first to bring your opponent\u2019s HP to zero and claim victory!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s not just about memory \u2014 use items, strategy, and mind games to dominate the showdown!</p>","developers":["Amakumo Co., Ltd."],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794570/0cbcc1aaa41702b6c170cbe8a1d4340a311c3e8b/header.jpg?t=1756776449","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/379